    <string name="settings_game_res_level_about">The game changes the sharpness of its 3D picture by itself. A fixed level keeps it there: a lower level is less work for the GPU, a higher one is sharper. A choice that caps the level lets the game lower it under load but not raise it past that level. From the next start; a DM_RES_LEVEL line in env.txt wins.</string>
